---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Returns & Exchanges Policy | Kitchen And All" description="Return window, exchange, refund and repair terms for Kitchen And All customers in Kenya.">
  <section class="min-h-[60vh] bg-slate-50 px-4 py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl md:p-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-orange-600">Returns Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">Returns &amp; Exchanges Policy</h1>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">30-Day Returns and Exchanges</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We accept returns and exchanges for eligible products within 30 days of delivery or collection.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">This policy applies to customers in Kenya and covers both defective and non-defective products, including custom-fabricated and made-to-order items where applicable.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Return Conditions</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Items must be unused and in new, resalable condition.</li>
            <li>Items should be returned with their original packaging where applicable.</li>
            <li>Products that have been damaged through misuse, negligence, unauthorised modification, or normal wear and tear may not qualify for a return.</li>
            <li>Custom-fabricated and made-to-order items may be assessed individually before a return, exchange, repair, or refund is approved.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Return Method</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Returns and exchanges are handled in store.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Before returning an item, please contact us first so that we can arrange a suitable time for the return at our Landhies Road workshop in Nairobi.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not currently offer courier collection for standard returns.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Defective Products</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">If a product is defective or has a fault attributable to our product or workmanship, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We will inspect the product and, where appropriate, arrange a repair, replacement, exchange, or refund.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Defective products are not subject to any restocking fee.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Non-Defective Returns</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We accept eligible non-defective returns within 30 days of delivery or collection.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">This includes returns due to change of mind or ordering the wrong item, provided the product meets the return conditions above.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">There is no restocking fee for eligible returns.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Refunds</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Once a returned item has been inspected and the return has been approved, refunds will be processed within 7 days.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Refunds are only issued after the returned product has been inspected and approved in accordance with this policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Exchanges</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Customers may request an exchange within 30 days of delivery or collection.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Exchanges are subject to product availability and the returned item meeting the conditions outlined in this policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">30-Day Installation Fault Cover</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For products supplied and installed by us, our installation is covered for faults reported within 30 days of installation.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If an installation-related issue occurs within this period, we will inspect the issue and, where the fault is attributable to our installation, repair it at no additional charge.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">If the issue cannot be repaired and the fault is determined to be our responsibility, we will arrange an appropriate remedy, which may include an exchange or other resolution.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Issues caused by misuse, incorrect operation, negligence, accidents, unauthorised modifications, or normal wear and tear are not covered under the installation fault provision.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Costs Outside the Return &amp; Installation Cover</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Where an issue falls outside the 30-day return period or the 30-day installation fault cover, we may assess the product and provide a repair or maintenance quotation before any chargeable work begins.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Any assessment, repair, replacement parts, or maintenance outside the applicable coverage may be chargeable to the customer.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For returns, exchanges, defective products, or installation issues, please contact us before bringing the item to our workshop so that we can assist you with the appropriate process.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="mailto:info@kitchenandall.co.ke">info@kitchenandall.co.ke</a> or message us on <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="https://wa.me/254741045143" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>